    "describe_ch": "本課程為輔助統計學課程之進行，讓同學可以更深入瞭解課程習題演練與相關統計軟體的操作。",
    "describe_eh": " This course is a statistics practice lesson. The purpose of this course is to assist students familiar with exercise and software operation.",
